# In loops a switch compares a text with its literals by the header that the cell holds: three cases of switched(), in two versions of the loop. A single comparison asks for no header unless a literal is written of the place (headers-of-written-literals.ir). An empty text and a text that is an index are no names. Outside of loops nothing changes.
